  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot ge\xE7mi\u015F sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "Ge\xE7mi\u015Fin i\xE7in \"T\u0131ls\u0131m Onlusu\" kart\u0131n\u0131 se\xE7ti\u011Fini
    g\xF6r\xFCyorum {{isim}}.\n\nBu kart, her y\xF6nden sa\u011Fl\u0131k ve bereketle
    ku\u015Fat\u0131ld\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 ifade ediyor. Etraf\u0131nda do\u011Fru
    insanlar\u0131n olmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011Flam\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n. Bu insanlar
    da seni g\xFCvence alt\u0131na alm\u0131\u015Flar ve ya\u015Fam\u0131n\u0131n
    kontrol\xFCnden \xE7\u0131kma ihtimalini bertaraf etmene vesile olmu\u015Flar.
    Ama\xE7lad\u0131\u011F\u0131n baz\u0131 \u015Feyleri ger\xE7ekle\u015Ftirebilmi\u015F,
    bir k\u0131sm\u0131n\u0131n da ger\xE7ekle\u015Fmesine zemin haz\u0131rlam\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n.
    Ailenin nam\u0131 ve varl\u0131klar\u0131, senin sayende de\u011Fer kazanm\u0131\u015F.
    Sevdiklerin seninle gurur duymu\u015Flar. Yapt\u0131klar\u0131n, yapacaklar\u0131n\u0131n
    da g\xFCvencesi olmu\u015F. Refah d\xFCzeyinin daha da y\xFCkselmesini bundan
    b\xF6yle an meselesi haline getirmi\u015Fsin."
